/pt 渲染圖確認；三條各一行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","text":"1.以民意為優先，監督鄉政。\n2.爭取經費，建設村里。\n3.關懷長者，照顧弱勢。","unresolved":0},{"document":"bulletin-10-007-090-03","entity":"2022-township-representative:10-007-090-03:3","id":"10-007-090-03-3-p1","image":null,"method":"模型判讀","ocr_check":null,"page":1,"reason":"文字層，對照 6.5 px/pt 渲染圖確認；六條各一行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","text":"1.專職熱誠服務、以民意為依歸。\n2.督促鄉公所，加強地方建設。\n3.關懷老弱家庭。\n4.繁榮地方，促進產業發展，謀取鄉民福利。\n5.維護好山、好水、好鄉土。\n6.重視環保、建設，提升生活品質。","unresolved":0}],"specificity":[{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-conditions","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出適用條件、排除對象或替代方案","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"funding","evidence":null,"id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-funding","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明經費從哪裡來","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"implementation","evidence":null,"id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-implementation","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明由哪個單位、以什麼程序執行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"instrument","evidence":null,"id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-instrument","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文只寫出目標或方向，沒有寫出採用的措施","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"quantity","evidence":null,"id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-quantity","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有可以核對的數字","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"schedule","evidence":null,"id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-schedule","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出時間安排","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-001","criterion":"target","evidence":"弱勢","id":"10-007-090-03-1-001-target","level":"partial","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文寫出「弱勢」，符合部分明示：指出受益或受規範的群體、地域或機構類別","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.5},{"claim":"10-007-090-03-1-002"